---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Alexis Millares Thomson">
  <main>
    <section class="mx-auto grid min-h-[calc(100vh-73px)] max-w-7xl grid-rows-[1fr_auto] px-6 py-8 md:px-10">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-12 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
        <section>
          <p class="mb-6 max-w-xl text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-neutral-600">
            Web developer · React · CMS
          </p>

          <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-5xl md:text-[3.35rem] lg:text-[3.6rem]">
            I build websites and tools<br class="hidden md:block" />
            for structured information.
          </h1>
        </section>

        <section class="border-l border-neutral-950 pl-6 md:pl-10">
          <p class="max-w-md text-xl leading-8 text-neutral-800">
            I'm a full-stack web developer based in Toronto. I work on React applications, CMS-backed websites, research databases, and interfaces for browsing complex content.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <section class="grid border-t border-neutral-950 md:grid-cols-2">
        <a
          href="/development"
          class="group border-b border-neutral-950 py-8 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:pr-8"
        >
          <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-neutral-600">
            01 / Development
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
            Web applications, content systems, and searchable interfaces.
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl leading-7 text-neutral-700">
            React, JavaScript, TypeScript, Tailwind, Contentful, Netlify, and custom data workflows for projects that need more than a static site.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold group-hover:underline">
            View development work →
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href="/music-theory" class="group py-8 md:pl-8">
          <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-neutral-600">
            02 / Music Theory
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
            Research, teaching, and interactive music-theory tools.
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl leading-7 text-neutral-700">
            My academic work focuses on musical structure, tuning systems, and analysis. Some of that work has become interactive software.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold group-hover:underline">
            View music-theory work →
          </p>
        </a>
      </section>

      <section class="grid border-t border-neutral-950 py-10 md:grid-cols-[0.45fr_1fr] md:gap-12">
        <div class="max-w-xs">
          <img
            src="/assets/profile.jpg"
            alt="Alexis Millares Thomson"
            class="w-full border border-neutral-950"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 md:mt-0">
          <p class="mb-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-neutral-600">
            About
          </p>

          <h2 class="max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.12] tracking-tighter md:text-4xl">
            I came to web development through music theory, research, and teaching.
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-800">
            I hold a PhD in Music Theory and a professional diploma in web development. My recent work includes React applications, CMS-backed research platforms, static sites, search and filtering systems, and tools for exploring musical structure.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-800">
            I'm especially interested in projects where the content is detailed, relational, or challenging to organize: archives, catalogues, research databases, educational tools, and editorial workflows.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-sm font-semibold">
            <a href="/development" class="hover:underline">
              Development work →
            </a>

            <a href="/music-theory" class="hover:underline">
              Music-theory work →
            </a>

            <a href="/projects" class="hover:underline">
              All projects →
            </a>

            <a href="/cv.pdf" class="hover:underline">
              View CV →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>